        XCTAssertEqual(valid.items.map(\.rawQuote),["Start with my task to photograph the sundial gnomon tomorrow.", "The gnomon was lent by Jessa, and Miro remembers the base being scratched before delivery; nobody has verified that memory. Keep the loan and uncertainty as one account. I am not promising to polish or replace it.", "In the middle of this capture, buy two packets of adhesive studs for my own display.", "The existing acrylic cover stays with Jessa and is not on that list.", "Near the end, after Halin confirms the stand is stable, ask Feri for the viewing height. Halin has inspected a photo but has not confirmed stability.", "Last, remind me November 25 at 6 PM to return Jessa’s measuring square to Tena. Jessa still owns it."])
