e people can step away from the noise. Keep that as an idea rather than adding another job for Friday.","priority":1,"reviewed":false,"semanticState":"resolved","temporal":"eyJraW5kIjoibm9uZSIsImlzVXNlckVkaXRlZCI6ZmFsc2UsInRpbWVab25lQmVoYXZpb3IiOiJkZXZpY2VMb2NhbCJ9","temporalKind":"none","title":"There is also an idea for next time, having a quiet corner where people can step away from the noise"},"title":"There is also an idea for next time, having a quiet corner where people can step away from the noise"},{"id":"59C9F93C-EE1E-4109-B280-EAC16AD59E90","isArchived":false,"isCompleted":false,"isReviewed":false,"itemType":"personFollowUp","modifiedAt":"2026-10-07T23:52:51Z","originalText":"And email Jonah the final volunteer rota once Priya has approved it. … She has looked at it, but she has not said it is approved. … That difference matters because I think two people are still swapping slots. … No, actually, the person collecting the rota is June, not Jonah. … Email June after Priya approves. … I am not changing any of the shifts myself in this recording.","personName":"June","snapshot":{"archived":false,"category":"people","confidence":0.88,"created":"2026-10-07T23:52:48Z","id":"59C9F93C-EE1E-4109-B280-EAC16AD59E90","kind":"personFollowUp","modified":"2026-10-07T23:52:51Z","needsClarification":false,"original":"And email Jonah the final volunteer rota once Priya has approved it. … She has looked at it, but she has not said it is approved. … That difference matters because I think two people are still swapping slots. … No, actually, the person collecting the rota is June, not Jonah. … Email June after Priya approves. … I am not changing any of the shifts myself in this recording.","parentCreated":"2026-10-07T23:52:48Z","parentID":"118C724A-62A2-4F6C-B125-563677C1A395","parentOriginal":"I am thinking about the club event on Friday, October ninth. The room itself is already confirmed, so that is one less thing to chase. I need to print the direction sign, the one with 